  "description": "gold filigree on dark umber: engraved gold bands looping round the set, a warm gold haze with sparkles along it, and blue jewel orbs strung on the arms, each a domed blue core in concentric gold rings with an ice-white glint",
  "reference": {
    "image": "ancient-empires-25.jpg",
    "folder": "fractal-drive-sync/style-refs",
    "made_with": "an escape-time render signed 'exoteric.roach.org', 2560x1600"
  },
  "suggested_colormap": "gilded_orbs",
  "reuses": [
    "field de, inverted, through the map by rank: dark umber far from the set, old gold beside it",
    "the light layer on field smooth at period 1: one embossed band per escape step, the filigree's looping bands",
    "a period sheet on field smooth (four fine lines a band) and field tia as a multiply glow: the engraving cut into the gold",
    "glow_filaments' falloff glow on de: a warm haze 0.03 frame widths wide and a hair of light along the set",
    "the bubble trap (bronze_packing), twice: a lattice of tiny discs as sparkles masked to the set, and one disc's bounded pullbacks as the orbs, each lit as a dome and cut into rings by a sheet",
    "channel inside cut into six bands: every interior component the same jewel",
    "the tone pass, at the reference's median and p10"
  ],
